: 1280PlayResY: 720Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.44,0:02:47.35,Title,,0,0,120,,Edward NewgateDialogue: 0,0:02:47.41,0:02:49.58,Main,,0,0,0,,You got to be kidding me!Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.68,0:03:04.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace...!Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.06,0:03:11.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.66,0:03:46.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.90,0:03:58.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire Fist Ace is dead!Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:18.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat-boy!Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:20.87,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He's losing it!Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.51,0:04:23.68,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,His life is in danger!Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.66,0:04:37.86,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Akainu!Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.32,0:04:42.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll get you this time for sure!Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.92,0:04:47.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.40,0:04:59.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let you kill him!Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.36,0:05:04.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun! Luffy-kun! Stay with me!Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.08,0:05:06.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Move out of my way!Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.48,0:05:15.96,Main,,0,0,0,,This war is not over yet!Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:21.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Take Ace's brother with you, Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.27,0:05:22.84,Main,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.66,0:05:27.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's life is how Ace's life will live on!Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.64,0:05:30.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Commander... Marco!Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.95,0:05:39.92,Main,,0,0,0,,We will protect him at any cost on Ace's behalf!Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.72,0:05:42.95,Main,,0,0,0,,If we let him die,Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.16,0:05:48.69,Main,,0,0,0,,it'll be a dishonor to the Whitebeard Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:57.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun, don't lose your sanity!Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.64,0:06:04.14,Main,,0,0,0,,I told you that I won't let the brothers get away!Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.35,0:06:12.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.95,0:06:15.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Akainu-san!Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.03,0:07:01.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops is furious!Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.73,0:07:03.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Guys, we gotta get out of here!Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:28.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Hellhound!Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.50,0:07:33.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:12.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Navy HQ is collapsing!Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.48,0:09:26.01,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.82,0:09:32.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard!Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.28,0:09:38.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Admiral Sakazuki!Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.89,0:09:45.20,Main,,0,0,0,,– Don't fall! – Hang on!Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.22,0:10:10.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it over?Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.14,0:10:14.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.06,0:10:23.97,Main,,0,0,0,,The plaza has split in two! The pirates are on the other side!Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.57,0:10:29.07,Main,,0,0,0,,We are completely separated from Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.07,0:10:31.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.98,0:10:36.95,Main,,0,0,0,,He is still this powerful after his gut has been burnt through?Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:44.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet.Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.93,0:10:54.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Everybody, get on the ships!Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.53,0:10:55.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.64,0:11:01.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Think about why Pops stayed over there and his last wish for us!Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.97,0:11:04.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Cry after you get on the ship!Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.44,0:11:08.28,Main,,0,0,0,,– Pops! Ace! – Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.44,0:11:15.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring all able ships to the bay!Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.04,0:11:19.20,Main,,0,0,0,,We won't let you get away!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.09,0:11:22.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, everyone!Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.03,0:11:30.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Salome! I can't stop worrying about Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.37,0:11:37.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! What is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.02,0:11:42.08,Main,,0,0,0,,There is something behind the HQ building!Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.08,0:11:44.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, they found me!Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.78,0:11:48.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Not only him! Who are they on the scaffold?Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.58,0:11:53.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh... They noticed us finally.Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.19,0:11:56.60,Main,,0,0,0,,It's you! How did you all get here?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:12:00.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are they here?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.42,0:12:05.64,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard.Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.08,0:12:09.26,Main,,0,0,0,,They're the most heinous criminalsDialogue: 0,0:12:09.26,0:12:13.61,Main,,0,0,0,,whose existence has been erased because of their brutality!Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.42,0:12:18.42,Main,,0,0,0,,He's the biggest of all living things!Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.42,0:12:22.20,Main,,0,0,0,,The Pirate – "Colossal Battleship" Sanjuan Wolf!Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:26.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, not only am I found, but they know who I am!Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.32,0:12:30.58,Main,,0,0,0,,"Corrupt King" Avalo Pizarro!Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.58,0:12:33.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I missed being back on the street!Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.00,0:12:36.66,Main,,0,0,0,,"Heavy Drinker" Vasco Shot!Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.80,0:12:46.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Am I allowed to kill them all?Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.50,0:12:49.61,Main,,0,0,0,,"Crescent Moon Hunter" Catarina Devon!Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.52,0:12:54.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I like you boys, too.Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.06,0:12:58.70,Main,,0,0,0,,And the Head Jailer of Impel Down...Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.70,0:13:00.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Shiryuu of the Rain!Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.47,0:12:26.89,Captions,,0,0,0,,"Colossal Battleship" Sanjuan WolfDialogue: 0,0:12:29.03,0:12:33.60,Captions,,0,0,0,,"Corrupt King" Avalo PizarroDialogue: 0,0:12:38.37,0:12:46.07,Captions,,0,0,0,,"Heavy Drinker" Vasco ShotDialogue: 0,0:12:48.03,0:12:54.55,Captions,,0,0,0,,"Crescent Moon Hunter" Catarina DevonDialogue: 0,0:12:55.65,0:13:00.56,Captions,,0,0,0,,Shiryuu of the RainDialogue: 0,0:13:01.14,0:13:03.26,Main,,0,0,0,,They're the Blackbeard Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.84,0:13:14.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Long time no see! I'm glad to be present at the time of your death!Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.18,0:13:15.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.94,0:13:18.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Teach...!Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.36,0:13:36.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Shiryuu! You...Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.56,0:13:42.27,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to Magellan? What happened to Impel Down?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.36,0:13:46.54,Main,,0,0,0,,How did you all get here?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.14,0:13:52.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Doesn't the fact that we are here answer your questions...Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.98,0:13:55.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Fleet Admiral Sengoku-san?Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.64,0:14:01.74,Main,,0,0,0,,If you want to know the details...Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.74,0:14:04.76,Main,,0,0,0,,you can go find out for yourself later.Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.76,0:14:08.20,Main,,0,0,0,,At any rate, I've decided to team up with these guys.Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.20,0:14:09.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I bid you farewell.Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.64,0:14:15.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Fleet Admiral Sengoku!Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.28,0:14:19.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't have a chance to report this to you earlier...Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.92,0:14:25.10,Main,,0,0,0,,But we received reports that the Gates of Justice had opened again...Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.10,0:14:27.85,Main,,0,0,0,,and an unauthorized warship passed through it!Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.52,0:14:31.14,Main,,0,0,0,,And these people were on that ship?Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.14,0:14:34.06,Main,,0,0,0,,But there shouldn't be anyone in the control room except our marines...Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.06,0:14:37.02,Main,,0,0,0,,and nothing out of the ordinary has been reported, either!Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.02,0:14:40.02,Main,,0,0,0,,How did they get here?Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.80,0:14:43.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I apologize.Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.66,0:14:46.77,Main,,0,0,0,,It is quite simple.Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.12,0:14:52.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Before the Blackbeard Pirates set sail for Impel Down,Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:56.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I hypnotized the marines in the control room...Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.10,0:14:59.48,Main,,0,0,0,,and gave them the order that all warships approaching the Gates of Justice...Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.48,0:15:01.25,Main,,0,0,0,,were to be allowed to pass.Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.10,0:15:05.92,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems this helped some others as well.Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.26,0:15:09.86,Main,,0,0,0,,For a pirate, an enemy of the Government...Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.86,0:15:14.19,Main,,0,0,0,,breaking into Impel Down would've been impossible, since the Gates of Justice would never open.Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.68,0:15:18.94,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I increased my reputation and became one of the Seven Warlords!Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.94,0:15:21.53,Main,,0,0,0,,But I don't need that rank any more!Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.94,0:15:27.37,Main,,0,0,0,,So your goal was to free those guys?Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.58,0:15:32.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Indeed! That was my plan all along!Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.01,0:15:34.78,Main,,0,0,0,,That was all I wanted!Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.78,0:15:37.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Now do you get it?Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.03,0:15:53.15,Main,,0,0,0,,None of that matters!Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.70,0:16:00.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Teach!Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.18,0:16:08.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Captain!Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.58,0:16:30.60,Main,,0,0,0,,That was really close!Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.60,0:16:33.17,Main,,0,0,0,,We barely made it out in time.Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.46,0:16:47.86,Main,,0,0,0,,You aren't holding back!Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.86,0:16:49.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that's to be expected.Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.32,0:16:57.45,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the one person I will never call my son, Teach.Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.78,0:17:06.02,Main,,0,0,0,,You broke the one iron rule on my ship...Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:08.84,Main,,0,0,0,,You killed a member of the crew!Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:12.61,Main,,0,0,0,,So that the Fourth Division Commander Thatch may rest in peace...Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.02,0:17:18.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I will take this fool's life, and settle the score!Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:21.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.40,0:17:26.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Marco!Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.94,0:17:29.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.60,0:17:36.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this!Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.80,0:17:38.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.94,0:17:40.80,Main,,0,0,0,,You got that?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.12,0:17:48.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's settle this, Teach!Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.98,0:17:53.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Fine by me!Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.63,0:18:06.97,Main,,0,0,0,,What is that black stuff coming out of his body?Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.10,0:18:09.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Smoke?Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.24,0:18:27.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Black Hole!Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.48,0:18:42.93,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the power of the Devil Fruit I stole after killing Thatch!Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.93,0:18:47.18,Main,,0,0,0,,The mightiest power, the Dark-Dark Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.18,0:18:50.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Have a good taste!Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.01,0:18:58.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pops. Thatch is dead, and so is Ace.Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.44,0:19:04.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I had always respected and admired you from the bottom of my heart.Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.00,0:19:05.96,Main,,0,0,0,,But now, you've grown old.Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.96,0:19:10.19,Main,,0,0,0,,So rusty, you couldn't save a single underling from execution!Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.62,0:19:15.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though I made sure to let Ace live after our battle on Banaro Island.Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.26,0:19:19.94,Main,,0,0,0,,That bastard...Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.77,0:19:23.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, now... That won't work.Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.06,0:19:28.05,Main,,0,0,0,,All Devil Fruit abilities are useless against me!Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.26,0:19:37.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Black Vortex!Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.04,0:19:46.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, Pops? What do you think about my darkness?Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.20,0:19:51.54,Main,,0,0,0,,It can even suck in Devil Fruit powers, making the users defenseless!Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.27,0:19:55.61,Main,,0,0,0,,In other words, you can't cause your earthquakes anym—Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.36,0:20:07.72,Main,,0,0,0,,That hurts...Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.72,0:20:09.49,Main,,0,0,0,,That hurts, damn it!Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.99,0:20:15.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Overconfidence... Carelessness...Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.62,0:20:17.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Those are your biggest weaknesses!Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.04,0:20:23.77,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Stop it...Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.34,0:20:28.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops, stop it! I'm your son, aren't I?Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.74,0:20:30.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you really going to kill me?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.23,0:20:51.90,Main,,0,0,0,,You did it, Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.70,0:20:56.80,Main,,0,0,0,,No... Look at that!Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.88,0:21:30.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-You monster!Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.87,0:21:35.81,Main,,0,0,0,,You should be dead!Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.24,0:21:40.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Can't you just die already?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.48,0:21:50.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.72,0:21:58.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Kill him, you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.60,0:22:25.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Do it! Turn him into a honeycomb!Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.00,0:22:36.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.50,0:22:47.04,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're dying, you say, Roger?Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.04,0:22:50.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I don't have much time left.Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.15,0:22:58.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Shall I tell you how to get to Raftel, Whitebeard?Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.44,0:23:02.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if you did, I wouldn't go. I'm not interested.Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.88,0:23:11.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you know what the Government calls me these days?Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.70,0:23:14.81,Main,,0,0,0,,"Gold Roger."Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.92,0:23:19.81,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Is that your real name?Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.81,0:23:22.30,Main,,0,0,0,,No, it's not.Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.30,0:23:26.02,Main,,0,0,0,,My name is Gol D. Roger.Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.02,0:23:29.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I've met some of those guys with "D" in their names myself.Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.98,0:23:37.96,Main,,0,0,0,,There's one in my crew too. His name is Teach.Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.10,0:23:41.73,Main,,0,0,0,,What's with that "D" anyway?Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.14,0:23:46.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You want to know?Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.38,0:23:52.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll tell you.Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.98,0:23:58.50,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a story from long ago...Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.62,0:24:08.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm out of bullets. Hey, someone give me another gun!Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.69,0:24:11.20,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not you...Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.20,0:24:13.93,Main,,0,0,0,,You're still alive?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.04,0:24:20.70,Main,,0,0,0,,The man Roger is waiting for...Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.70,0:24:23.48,Main,,0,0,0,,at the very least, Teach...Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.48,0:24:25.88,Main,,0,0,0,,it's definitely not you.Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.36,0:24:31.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Just like there are those who carry on Roger's will...Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.40,0:24:38.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure someone will appear to carry on Ace's will, someday.Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.64,0:24:44.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if you extinguish his bloodline, there's no way that their flame will ever burn out.Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.90,0:24:51.33,Main,,0,0,0,,It has been passed down since ancient times...Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.14,0:24:57.38,Main,,0,0,0,,And in the future... someday...Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.38,0:25:02.52,Main,,0,0,0,,someone will appear, shouldering the burden of history for all those centuries,Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.52,0:25:08.00,Main,,0,0,0,,and challenge the whole world to a fight.Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.06,0:25:11.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Sengoku...Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.24,0:25:14.76,Main,,0,0,0,,You and the World Government...Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.76,0:25:24.74,Main,,0,0,0,,all fear the coming war and the immense impact it will have worldwide.Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.94,0:25:29.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care myself...Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.46,0:25:34.28,Main,,0,0,0,,but as soon as someone finds that great treasure...Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.84,0:25:38.18,Main,,0,0,0,,the entire world will be turned upside down.Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.88,0:25:41.52,Main,,0,0,0,,And someone will find it.Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.90,0:25:46.46,Main,,0,0,0,,That day will definitely come sooner or later.Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.77,0:25:57.47,Main,,0,0,0,,One Piece...Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.74,0:26:01.47,Main,,0,0,0,,does exist!Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.52,0:26:13.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn you!Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.46,0:26:20.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Those are some magnificent last words!Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.42,0:26:26.50,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Forgive me... my sons...Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.26,0:26:32.94,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'm responsible for one hell of a fool...Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.94,0:26:38.14,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,But thanks to all of you, I had everything I ever wanted.Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.92,0:26:44.58,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This is the end for me.Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.50,0:26:55.13,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Now, that's odd! A pirate who doesn't care about treasure?Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.13,0:26:58.08,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you want, then?Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.86,0:27:01.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Newgate!Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.40,0:27:08.17,Main,,0,0,0,,There's one thing I've wanted, ever since I was a kid.Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.17,0:27:10.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, there is?Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.69,0:27:11.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Tell us!Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.24,0:27:22.36,Main,,0,0,0,,A family.Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.69,0:27:27.36,Main,,0,0,0,,A family? What's that supposed to mean?Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.88,0:27:32.20,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful to you.Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.40,0:27:37.78,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Farewell, my sons.Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.82,0:28:00.97,Main,,0,0,0,,H-He died...Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.97,0:28:02.66,Main,,0,0,0,,while still standing!Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.16,0:28:08.13,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard is dead.Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.16,0:28:29.32,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Even in death, his body did not fall.Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.32,0:28:33.64,Narrator,,0,0,0,,His body, striking down foes while riddled with wounds...Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.64,0:28:35.96,Narrator,,0,0,0,,was truly monstrous.Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.88,0:28:45.66,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The total number of sword wounds he received in this battle...Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.66,0:28:49.68,Narrator,,0,0,0,,was 267.Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.68,0:28:54.04,Narrator,,0,0,0,,He was shot by 152 bullets.Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.04,0:28:57.45,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And was hit by 46 cannonballs.Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.10,0:29:01.92,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And despite all this...Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.55,0:29:05.66,Narrator,,0,0,0,,his proud back...Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.66,0:29:11.16,Narrator,,0,0,0,,over the course of his entire life as a pirate...Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.16,0:29:15.74,Narrator,,0,0,0,,never received a single scar from running away!Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.29,0:29:38.94,Title,,0,0,220,,In memory of Kinryu ArimotoDialogue: 0,0:00:25.37,0:00:30.41,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing SewilDialogue: 0,0:00:30.41,0:00:36.22,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Quality Control PepperjackDialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:41.19,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Timing Sewil HaleeDialogue: 0,0:00:41.19,0:00:46.93,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Translation Yibis GaijinDialogue: 0,0:00:46.93,0:00:52.36,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Visual Effects Datenshi KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:52.36,0:00:57.44,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Graphics DatenshiDialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:01:03.08,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Karaoke KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:01:03.08,0:01:06.56,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Soundtracking HaleeDialogue: 0,0:01:06.56,0:01:08.68,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Raws OPFans FUNiDialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:26.80,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:26.80,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.68,0:00:25.50,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,ADialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:26.90,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,ADialogue: 1,0:00:24.76,0:00:25.62,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,mDialogue: 1,0:00:24.76,0:00:25.62,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:00:24.76,0:00:25.62,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:27.02,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,meDialogue: 1,0:00:24.84,0:00:25.81,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 0,0:00:25.81,0:00:27.21,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:00:24.92,0:00:26.18,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 1,0:00:24.92